# Repo-root .dockerignore — read only by builds whose CONTEXT IS THE REPO ROOT
# (the ddl-apply contract image; the ingestion/compute builds use context code/
# and read code/.dockerignore instead). Keeps the context lean: git, build
# output, and logs (except the schema-compat matrix evidence the image bakes).
.git
.freebuff
**/target
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.idea
.vscode
*.iml
logs/*
!logs/schema-compat/
!logs/schema-compat/composite-pk-raw-client-20260815.md
